<title>USA: Intimate Brands Dec same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Intimate Brands Dec same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intimate Brands Inc said Thursday it had net sales for the five weeks ended January 4 of $687.6 million, up from $573.6 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company said its comparable-store sales for the five weeks increased four percent.</p>
</text>
